        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 2.89m (9'6\") x 2.92m (9'7\")\nComposit Front Door, Panelled Walls, Timber Flooring, Radiator, Spotlights, Shelving, |Timber Staircase.\n\nKitchen - 3.73m (12'3\") x 7.91m (25'11\")\nFully Fitted Wall & Floor Units, Stainless Steel Sink, Electric Hob, Extractor Fan, Electric Oven, Integrated Dishwasher and Fried Freezer. Large Kitchen Island with 4 Stools and Storage. Large Patio Doors to Rear Garden, Spotlights. (T.V. Excluded)\n\nUtility Room\nDouble Doors From Kitchen, Built-In Units, Plumbing for Washing Machine\n\nLiving Room - 2.79m (9'2\") x 4.56m (15'0\")\nBespoke Shelving and Storage Cupboards, Electric Fire, T.V Sockets, Wooden Flooring, Radiator, Spotlights (T.V. Excluded)\n\nGuest W.C. - 1.45m (4'9\") x 1.42m (4'8\")\nVanity Unity with Round Sink and Mixer Tap, W.C. Panelled Walls with Wallpaper.\n\nHallway - 1.01m (3'4\") x 5.96m (19'7\")\n\nLanding Floor 1 - 0.99m (3'3\") x 0.92m (3'0\")\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.48m (11'5\") x 2.85m (9'4\")\nTo Rear:\nBuilt-In Double Deck Bed Unit with Stairs and a Slide. Built-In Wardrobes, Shelving, Timber Flooring, Radiator, Spotlights. ( T.V. Excluded)\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.77m (12'4\") x 4.18m (13'9\")\nMaster to Front:\nBuilt-In Wardrobes, Timber Flooring, Radiator,\n\nBathroom - 2.84m (9'4\") x 2.31m (7'7\")\nStand Alone Bath with Mixer Taps & Shower Head, Shower Cubicle with Electric Shower and 2 Shower Heads, Vanity Unit with 2 Round Wash Hand Basins and 2 Mixer Taps, Heated Towel Rail, Fully Tiled Floor & Walls, Spotlights.\n\nFloor 2 - 3.92m (12'10\") x 4.14m (13'7\")\nRecreation Room:\n2 Velux Windows, Carpeted Staircase, Radiator, Carpet.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
